[
  /*
	The sum of all attribute modifiers has to follow this recursive function
	 * sum(level) = (level < 0) ? 0 : (2+level+sum(level-1))
	 * = 2+(((level+5)*level)/2)
	 * which corresponds to this list:
	 * 0) 2
	 * 1) 5
	 * 2) 9
	 * 3) 14
	 * 4) 20
	 * 5) 27
	 * 6) 35
	 * 7) 44

	Tutti i modificatori hanno una UpgradeCategory:
	Material (corrisponde alla definizione di "fatto con..."),
	Structural (good, light, ruined, encrusted, flexible,...),
	Refining ("rifiniture/raffinatezza", per esempio: rough, sharp, wornout, with art decoratino, broken, fragile, thinner, bended),
	Rune, CharacterClass, CharacterRace, Blessing, Coloring, Incarnation, Misc,
	Focusing (es: "of Strength") ...
	*/
